## Files used in our data process

| File | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `collector.py` | Collects headlines, runs RoBERTa and updates the CSV |
| `auto_collector.py` | Runs the collector every 30 minutes |
| `solarmood.csv` | Stores our collected headlines and AI predictions |
| `dashboard.py` | Reads the CSV and shows charts and filters |
| `SolarMood_ Human Sentiment Evaluation (1).xlsx` | Contains our manually labelled headlines |
| `evaluate.py` | Compares human labels with RoBERTa |
| `compare_models.py` | Compares RoBERTa and VADER with human labels |
| `sentiment_evaluation_results.csv` | Saves the human-versus-RoBERTa comparison |
| `model_comparison_results.csv` | Saves the comparison including VADER |
